[{"code":"not_implemented","severity":"error","span":{"file":"Main.beni","start":{"line":41,"col":10},"end":{"line":41,"col":21}},"title":"NOT IMPLEMENTED YET","message":"This program's subscriptions depend on its model, and `browser-inline` compiles\na set of subscriptions that is the same for the page's life: a set that changes\nis not supported on browser-inline yet (`docs/design/browser-inline.md` §3; §5,\nclass 3). Write `subscriptions` so that it does not read the model, and let\n`update` ignore what it does not need."}]
